{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>VibeCut 是一款專為短影音創作者設計的影片編輯工具，今天限時免費中。它徹底解決了傳統剪輯軟體操作繁瑣、耗時的問題，讓你能在幾秒鐘內製作出與音樂節拍完美同步的專業級影片，無論是 TikTok、Reels 還是 YouTube Shorts，一鍵就能產出爆款內容。不需要任何剪輯經驗，只需選取影片、配上音樂、點擊特效，就能完成令人驚豔的作品。</p>\n\n<h2>節拍同步特效與豐富模板</h2>\n<p>內建強大的節拍偵測功能，自動為影片加入縮放、閃爍、抖動、旋轉等多種特效，讓每一個畫面都精準踩點。同時提供多款預設模板，涵蓋電影感、故障風、旅行 vlog 等風格，一鍵套用即可獲得網紅級質感。此外還支援 4K 60fps 輸出與內建免版稅音樂庫，後製調整亮度、對比等參數也直覺易用。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-1-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-2-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-3-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-4-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-5-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>VibeCut 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶點擊領取連結後，看到兌換價格為 $0 即可免費收下。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 3825\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/IMG_3825-473x1024.webp\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-02T23:18:41.203984+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}